e it was jon and saw two it was  amanda in saw four it was hoffman and in  jigsaw  it was nelson this time detective shank  makes it appear as if he's been killed  only to reveal that he did this by  leaving his tattoo on the real victim's  arm  there's also a nice detail in this scene  where they go to interrogate pete  pete is the one who shot shank's father  and shank stays back behind his partner  out of fear of possibly being recognized  even though he was just a kid when they  last met the next victim is the police  captain angie garza she is trapped  inside the evidence room by the pig mast  shank  it makes sense because only a police  officer would be able to get into this  room  the door to the evidence room is secured  by vincent and jewell's safe company if  that sounds familiar it's because  vincent and jules are the two main  characters in the 1994 crime movie pulp  fiction  jules was played by actor samuel l  jackson who also plays chief marcus  banks in spyral  marcus banks is the father of zeke banks  and the only character to call him by  his full name  this may be a reference to pulp fiction  where one of the most famous scenes  features samuel l jackson quoting a  bible verse called ezekiel 25 17.  anyway captain garza is put into the wax  trap which will smother her face in hot  wax if she's unable to sever her spinal  cord with the blade under her neck  it's not really clear how this trap  works mechanically but there are a  number of jigsaw traps that share the  same concept of drowning or smothering  the victim  if they can't complete their task on  time from the pig vat and saw 3 to the  water cube and saw five to the silo and  jigsaw with those that he has deemed to  be bad cops out of the way  shank is ready for the finale of his  plan and kidnapped zeke who awakens  changed to a pipe  obviously this is a callback to the  beginning of the first movie so i'm not  even gonna count that on the things you  missed but after escaping he discovers  pete who is caught in the last jigsaw  inspired trap the glass grinder  this one is just like the freezer room  from saw three the only difference is  that instead of the victim being sprayed  with freezing water while someone tries  to find the key to set them free pete is  getting sliced apart by shards of glass  shanks hideout is in an abandoned soap  factory this is another common trait  shared with jigsaw who always used  abandoned factories as his hideouts and  locations for his games  it even has the obligatory sliding door  although nobody says the iconic line  game over in this one  the final trap is the puppet trap where  chief banks is hung up on strings and  zeke must decide between saving him or  killing shank  this one isn't really inspired by a  jigsaw trap from what i can tell but the  explanation of the trap is definitely  familiar  roll it do you know there's 1.5 gallons  of blood in the human body zeke  at the rate your old man's bleeding out  in just three minutes  those jars will be full and your dad  will be dead  the human body for instance is an  astoundingly durable  creation it contains approximately 10  pints of  blood yet it is still able to operate  with just half of that 10 pints is only  equal to 1.25 gallons i looked it up and  i guess the average body has 1.2 to 1.5  gallons of blood  so they're kind of both right in a way  this trap not only takes place behind  this wall graffitied with jigsaw spiral  symbol but it's also located at the top  of a spiral staircase  well kind of after a classic saw style  montage detective shank or if we're  calling him by his real name william  emerson  slips away in an elevator just as jigsaw  did way back in darren lin bausman's  first saw movie  saw two i want to give a big thanks to  lionsgate for sponsoring this video  check out the link in the description to  purchase your own copy of spyral but to  fully understand the world of saw you'll  need to click that playlist on the left  for things you missed episodes on every  single movie remember to subscribe to  cz's world for new horrors every week  ring the death bell for all  notifications and i'll see you in the  next one  assuming we both survive
 

